---
import { mileage } from '../data/portfolio';
---
<article class="featured-project">
  <a class="project-cover" href={mileage.href} aria-label={`${mileage.title} 프로젝트 보기`}>
    <img src="/images/yonsei-mileage/figure-01-service-overview.png" alt="Yonsei Mileage 서비스 화면" width="1705" height="1115" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  </a>
  <div class="project-card-body">
    <div class="project-story">
      <p class="eyebrow">PROJECT 01 · {mileage.category}</p>
      <h2><a href={mileage.href}>{mileage.title}</a></h2>
      <p class="project-subtitle">{mileage.subtitle}</p>
      <p class="project-description">과거 수강신청 데이터로 성공확률을 추정하고, 제한된 72점을 최적으로 배분하는 의사결정 도구입니다.</p>
      <ul class="topic-list" aria-label="프로젝트 주제">
        {mileage.tags.slice(0, 3).map(tag => <li>{tag}</li>)}
      </ul>
      <div class="action-links">
        <a class="button-primary" href={mileage.href}>자세히 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href={mileage.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <dl class="project-result">
      <dt>Key result</dt>
      <dd><strong>30.75%</strong><span>과거 평균 대비<br />예측 오차 감소</span></dd>
    </dl>
  </div>
</article>
